---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Mewi · Intro">
  <header class="intro-head">
    <div class="label">Intro</div>
    <h1 class="serif">A small system for watching digital cats become specific.</h1>
    <p>
      Mewi separates the cat's inner life from the player's report. The backend
      chooses intent, action, memory, and social response; Unity confirms what
      actually completed; the report site turns those traces into quiet pages.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="intro-grid">
    <article>
      <div class="label">1 · Cat mind</div>
      <p>
        Each persona is a narrow behavioral lens. The same world snapshot can
        become caution, appetite, curiosity, warmth, or mischief depending on
        which cat receives it.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <div class="label">2 · Living journal</div>
      <p>
        Raw graph logs become per-cat records: main wants, signature actions,
        places, social rooms, relationships, and memorable turns.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <div class="label">3 · Human report</div>
      <p>
        The report page remains about the player's behavioral trace: how they
        waited, approached, repaired, and divided attention across cats.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
.intro-head {
  min-height: 48vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
  padding-bottom: 2rem;
}
.intro-head h1 {
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 4.7rem);
  line-height: 1;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin: .8rem 0 1rem;
}
.intro-head p {
  max-width: 560px;
  color: var(--ink2);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}
.intro-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 1rem;
}
.intro-grid article {
  min-height: 190px;
  border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--surface);
  padding: 1rem;
}
.intro-grid .label {
  margin-bottom: .9rem;
}
.intro-grid p {
  color: var(--ink2);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

@media (max-width: 740px) {
  .intro-head { min-height: 34vh; }
  .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
